  "explanation": "The question asks for the country(ies) of Chintamani Acharya’s citizenship. Two conflicting claims are present in the provided sources. Document d1 explicitly states that Acharya was granted citizenship of the Kingdom of Italy in 1905 (D1S3, D1S9). Conversely, document d2 describes him as a citizen of India and emphasizes his lifelong contributions to Indian society (D2S1, D2S3, D2S10–D2S12). Both documents provide direct evidence for their respective claims, and neither refutes the possibility of dual citizenship. Since the sources do not clarify whether both claims are simultaneously valid or contradictory, both answers are preserved as distinct valid referents."
